{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111557","id":2907741572,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tUJ2E","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111557","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111557.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111557.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111557","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111557/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111557/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111557/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/54510d550e100c6285af2061738526b02d655dd9","number":111557,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve compile time with `libc++` by defining `_LIBCPP_REMOVE_TRANSITIVE_INCLUDES` in `typedefs.h`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Helps address #111218 \r\n\r\nIn a quick test, this improved compile time on macOS from `5m6s` to `4m43s` (~8%).\r\nIt does this by reducing the impact of many of the `<libcpp>/` entries in the include tracker (#111218). For example, `<libcpp>/string` is reduced from 425s to 86s.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\n`libc++` had been created with many transitive includes, which means that including one file often led to implicit inclusion of other files. In recent versions (C++23 and later) they have been working to reduce this. However, they also offer a macro that allows users to disable transitive includes earlier than this (`_LIBCPP_REMOVE_TRANSITIVE_INCLUDES`).\r\nFor more information, see https://libcxx.llvm.org/DesignDocs/HeaderRemovalPolicy.html\r\n\r\nThis change affects platforms using libc++, which most prominently includes Apple platforms and Android.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","d